cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Manuscript Skills, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "Manuscript Skills"
abstract: >-
  Skills for Claude Code and Codex that help scientists prepare manuscripts for publication: they review a
  draft, check its references, numbers and figures, simulate the referees of a target journal, edit the prose
  under a script that fails any edit that strengthens a claim or changes a number, choose and prepare for a
  journal, and answer the referees after a decision.
authors:
